<title>Austria: ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG TAKES WOMEN'S SUPER-G.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG TAKES WOMEN'S SUPER-G.</headline>
<dateline>BAD KLEINKIRCHHEIM, Austria 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden won a World Cup women's super-G on Sunday ahead of Isolde Kostner of Italy and Katja Seizinger of Germany, according to unofficial results.</p>
</text>
